234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 155 0 R
/T (The vision for this project is to create a modern, employer-focused digital experience that reflects the quality, professionalism, and reliability of Platinum Staffing & Recruitment. Rather than competing as another staffing agency, Platinum Staffing should position itself as a strategic workforce solutions partner capable of helping organizations solve workforce challenges through responsive service, industry expertise, and long-term partnerships. Every element of the website should reinforce confidence, demonstrate capability, and encourage employers to begin a conversation with Platinum Staffing. The website should also provide job seekers with a welcoming, intuitive experience that reflects Platinum Staffing's commitment to helping individuals build meaningful careers. By combining thoughtful branding, intentional messaging, and a seamless user experience, the redesigned website will position Platinum Staffing for continued growth while supporting the company's objective of expanding employer partnerships and strengthening its presence throughout thestaffing industry.)
/E (The vision for this project is to create a modern, employer-focused digital experience that reflects the quality, professionalism, and reliability of Platinum Staffing & Recruitment. Rather than competing as another staffing agency, Platinum Staffing should position itself as a strategic workforce solutions partner capable of helping organizations solve workforce challenges through responsive service, industry expertise, and long-term partnerships. Every element of the website should reinforce confidence, demonstrate capability, and encourage employers to begin a conversation with Platinum Staffing. The website should also provide job seekers with a welcoming, intuitive experience that reflects Platinum Staffing's commitment to helping individuals build meaningful careers. By combining thoughtful branding, intentional messaging, and a seamless user experience, the redesigned website will position Platinum Staffing for continued growth while supporting the company's objective of expanding employer partnerships and strengthening its presence throughout thestaffing industry.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
