320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 159 0 R
/T (At Platinum Staffing & Recruitment, we believe every successful business begins with the right people. Our role extends beyond recruitment. We help organizations build dependable workforces that strengthen operations, support growth, and create lasting success. Every placement represents more than filling a position. It represents the beginning of a partnership built on trust, professionalism, and shared success. As businesses grow, workforce needs evolve. Platinum Staffing is committed to evolving alongside our clients by delivering responsive staffing solutions, maintaining strong relationships, and connecting organizations with qualified professionals who make a meaningful impact. Our purpose is simple: To help businesses build stronger teams, create greater opportunities, and move forward with confidence.)
